          "chunk_id": "s07_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c2_extends_linear_curse_memory_nonlinea",
          "text": "This extends the linear curse of memory to the nonlinear regime and proves the failure on long-term dependencies is intrinsic to the RNN hypothesis space, not just a training artifact. The numerics back this up.",
